      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "> I also encountered this problem. I compiled on an M4 MAX device. For the LLAMA3 model, I selected -p and the compilation time exceeded one and a half hours (it was not completed when I came to the issue). I rewrote setup_env.py myself. Supporting ninja and multi-core did not speed up the compilation process.\n\nSorry to hear that you experienced the same tragedy as me. My pull request has been published for 3 weeks and the maintainers did not reply. I presume they may get fired in Microsoft's global layoffs.\n\nLet's just relax and pray for them.",
